3) systematic non-fulfillment by the employee without valid reasons of the duties assigned to him by the employment contract or the rules of the internal labor procedure, if disciplinary sanctions were previously applied to the employee;

4) absenteeism (including absence from work for more than three hours during the working day) without valid reasons;

