 inclusive - five subsistence minimums for able-bodied persons established by law on January 1 of the calendar year in which the employer or his authorized person submitted the documents;

3) for permits issued for a period of one year to two years inclusive - eight subsistence minimums for able-bodied persons established by law on January 1 of the calendar year in which the employer or his authorized person submitted the documents;

4) for permits issued for a period of two to three years inclusively, ten subsistence minimums for able-bodied persons established by law on January 1 of the calendar year in which the employer or his authorized person submitted the documents.

